<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">2Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waannisa Xaafeez Nam77inth Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Waannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Wan.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waannisa Xaafeez Nam7intho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Waannisa xaafeez nam7intho kiita, Yesuusa hawaare maaqqeez cimay, Waannisa xaafeeza. Xaafintteezaykka maraxintteez godattatisinne I na7itayis. Oonii eree, yeykka pettii woosa keethatisinnee ize goynniza asayis maaqqekka attaamii. Yha qanthi kiitay xaafintteezay, unttii woli siiqinttod garkk akaakisodayisinnee worddo asitamaaritayppennee u timirttaypp naaginttoday garkk qofisodayisi.</para>
  <para style="iot">2 Waannisa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siiqo ubbaypp aadho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">4-6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Worddo timirttaypp naagintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">7-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">12-13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Ta cimay maraxintteez godatatisinnee i na7itayis kiitteez kiita. Ta aadda baazin tuma erizitay ubbay yinttan dosiza. <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>Yha tumay nuur yeza gishonnee tiinasi medhinaskka nuur yezoday gishos taanii yinttan turo dosiza.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Xooss Adaypp e Na7a Yesuus Kiristtoosapp aadho keehatithay, maarotithayinnee sarotithay tumarannee siiqor wolla nuur maaqqo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumabaggannee siiqo bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Aday nuna azazeezayigarkk, ne na7itaypp pettay pettay, tumar miinggii eqqeezana bi7ii taanii lo7ith ufaytteeza. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Godattee, yhattekka nuunii ubbay pettay petta siiqoday garkk taanii nena woosiza. Yha azazay tiinapp nuur yeza azazopp attin taanii nees xaafizay oroth azazo baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Wan. 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Tuma siiqqay nuunii Xooss azaza folo. Ma tiinapp yi si7eezay garkk e azazay, yi ubbay siiqor yezoday garkkes.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa as maaqqii ye7eezana ammanoowa, balethiza gaame asitay, alamel denddeeza. Yeyigarkk as oonkka balethizayannee Kiristtoosa morkke. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Yi ootheez kunth woyita ekkodayis miinggoytta. Yi ootheezay dhabaamay garkk naaginttoytta.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Kiristtoosa timirttayid miinggii eqqozayirannee E timirttaypp haakkitar yhanigiza athayir Xoossii baaya. Kiristtoosa timirttayid miinggii eqqeezayir Adayinne Na7ay yeza. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Oonkka yinttiko yi7ttar yha timirtta ekkekka yi7iko, yi kara gelssipate; sarokka giipatte. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Eza saro giz oonkka e iita oosayid ezar shaakinttiza.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith saroth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Taanii yinttis xaafodayis koyeez gaame baz yeza, zin worqqater xaafodayis koyooya. Nu ufayssay polinttoday garkk yinttar woli hellii odinttodayis yinttiko yhanigoda gi qoppiza.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Xoossii dooreez ne mishitii na7itay nena saro yeegiza.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
